5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm Rin! Let's find the werewolf super fast! Who do you think is acting suspicious already?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Hello. I am George. Let us remain calm and observe each other's behavior logically. Haste often leads to mistakes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm Daisuke. I'll... I'll just try my best to help.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good day to you all, dear children. I am Shizue. Let us be kind to one another while we seek the truth together.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone, I'm Midori. It's nice to meet you all. I hope we can work together harmoniously to protect our village.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Boring! We should be more excited! @George, you're being too stiff. Let's just start guessing!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Guessing is not a strategy, Rin. We must rely on evidence and inconsistencies in speech.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with George. Maybe we should be careful...,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Rin. George is only thinking of our safety. A gentle heart and a clear mind are our best tools.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think both perspectives have merit. While we need to be observant, keeping a positive atmosphere will help us trust each other.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Trust is okay, but finding the bad guy is more fun! I'm going to watch everyone really closely!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,Observation is indeed the key. I shall keep a distance and analyze the flow of the conversation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm not very good at this... but I'll listen to what you all say.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"That is a wonderful way to start, Daisuke. Just be yourself, and the truth will reveal itself in time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Let's try to support one another. If anyone feels uneasy, please feel free to share it with us.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! I'm ready for the night! I hope the Seer finds something juicy!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established a basic understanding. I shall now reflect on our introductions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope I don't make any mistakes. Good luck everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sleep well, everyone. May we wake up to a morning filled with clarity and peace.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's all try to stay calm and trust our instincts tomorrow. Good night.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
