33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Wake up! Wake up! Did the Seer find the werewolf? Tell us right now!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,George,,"Patience, Rin. The Seer may not wish to reveal themselves immediately to avoid becoming a target.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I'm a bit scared. I don't know who to believe...,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. It is a heavy burden, but I must tell you that George is the werewolf.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh! Shizue-san, are you the Seer? That is quite a shocking revelation to start the day.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,I knew it! George was way too stiff and boring! Let's just vote him out right now!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, that is a bold claim. Are you truly the Seer, or are you simply trying to frame me to protect your own identity?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Shizue-san seems so kind... she wouldn't lie, right? But George-san is so calm...","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I do not wish to cause conflict, but I cannot lie to you all. George is indeed the one we seek.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It's a difficult situation. Shizue-san's kindness makes her believable, but we should consider if this is a trap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,Stop overthinking it! Shizue said he's the wolf! Why are we still talking? Let's just do it!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,George,,Logic dictates that a Werewolf or Possessed could easily fake a Seer's claim to eliminate a neutral party. We should be cautious.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I trust Shizue-san more. She's always been so gentle...,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I understand your doubts, George, but my vision was clear. Please, for the sake of the village, trust me.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Midori,,"If Shizue-san is the Seer, we can end this now. If she isn't, we lose a villager. But her sincerity is hard to ignore.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,Exactly! Let's just vote George! I'm so excited to win this!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,George,,It is unfortunate that you all prefer emotion over a cautious analysis. I will accept your decision with dignity.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm sorry, George-san... but I'll follow Shizue-san.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am sorry it had to be this way, George. I wish you peace.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Midori,,I believe the balance of trust leans toward Shizue-san. I will cast my vote for George.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
